# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The shippable CCK lives in Assets/CVR.CCK (Assembly-CSharp layout,
# same as a .unitypackage install). Everything else under Assets/ is
# local project content (DynamicBone stub installs, test assets)
# and stays out of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
Assets/*
!Assets/CVR.CCK/
!Assets/csc.rsp
!Assets/csc.rsp.meta

# Package payload dependencies live outside the package or are resolved
# by VCC at install time; keep only the manifests for reference.
Packages/*
!Packages/manifest.json
!Packages/packages-lock.json
!Packages/com.fttristan.cck-advanced/

# Reference copies of the official CCK kept for diffing.
Official/

# Stray asset folders dropped at the project root.
Poi/
Thry/
